{"title":"Wikipedia — did you know?","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Main_Page","favicon":"https://en.wikipedia.org/static/favicon/wikipedia.ico","elements":[{"title":"Henryk Sztompka","contents":"... that a brewery owner who sheltered pianist <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Henryk_Sztompka\" title=\"Henryk Sztompka\">Henryk Sztompka</a></b> <i>(pictured)</i> and his family after the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Warsaw_Uprising\" title=\"Warsaw Uprising\">Warsaw Uprising</a> in 1944 brought in a piano so that he could continue practicing?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Henryk_Sztompka","retrieved":1788213604896},{"title":"dismissal of Mykhailo Fedorov","contents":"... that the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Protests_against_the_dismissal_of_Mykhailo_Fedorov\" title=\"Protests against the dismissal of Mykhailo Fedorov\">dismissal of Mykhailo Fedorov</a></b>, the Ukrainian minister of defence, sparked a series of protests demanding the removal of the commander-in-chief instead?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Protests_against_the_dismissal_of_Mykhailo_Fedorov","retrieved":1788213604897},{"title":"Charlotte Bryant","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charlotte_Bryant\" title=\"Charlotte Bryant\">Charlotte Bryant</a></b> begged <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Edward_VIII\" title=\"Edward VIII\">King Edward<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">&nbsp;</span>VIII</a>, \"don't let them kill me on Wednesday\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charlotte_Bryant","retrieved":1788213604899},{"title":"Auf dem Strom","contents":"... that <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Franz_Schubert\" title=\"Franz Schubert\">Franz Schubert</a>'s lied \"<b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Auf_dem_Strom\" title=\"Auf dem Strom\">Auf dem Strom</a></b>\" was composed for the only public concert in which he presented his own works?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Auf_dem_Strom","retrieved":1788213604901},{"title":"Ha Ming","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ha_Ming\" title=\"Ha Ming\">Ha Ming</a></b> was one of only two men who remained with the captive <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emperor_Yingzong_of_Ming\" title=\"Emperor Yingzong of Ming\">Emperor Yingzong of Ming</a> throughout his captivity by the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oirats\" title=\"Oirats\">Oirats</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ha_Ming","retrieved":1788213604909},{"title":"cardinality","contents":"... that, in certain theories of <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cardinality\" title=\"Cardinality\">cardinality</a></b>, not only are there infinitely many sizes of infinity, <span class=\"nowrap\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">⁠</span><span class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/math\" about=\"#mwt11\" data-mw=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;math&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;\\\\aleph_0,\\\\aleph_1,...,\\\\aleph_\\\\omega,...&quot;}}\"><span class=\"mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y\" style=\"display: none;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mathjax_ignore\" alttext=\"{\\displaystyle \\aleph _{0},\\aleph _{1},...,\\aleph _{\\omega },...}\">\n  <semantics>\n    <mrow class=\"MJX-TeXAtom-ORD\">\n      <mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\">\n        <msub>\n          <mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℵ<!-- ℵ --></mi>\n          <mrow class=\"MJX-TeXAtom-ORD\">\n            <mn>0</mn>\n          </mrow>\n        </msub>\n        <mo>,</mo>\n        <msub>\n          <mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℵ<!-- ℵ --></mi>\n          <mrow class=\"MJX-TeXAtom-ORD\">\n            <mn>1</mn>\n          </mrow>\n        </msub>\n        <mo>,</mo>\n        <mo>.</mo>\n        <mo>.</mo>\n        <mo>.</mo>\n        <mo>,</mo>\n        <msub>\n          <mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℵ<!-- ℵ --></mi>\n          <mrow class=\"MJX-TeXAtom-ORD\">\n            <mi>ω<!-- ω --></mi>\n          </mrow>\n        </msub>\n        <mo>,</mo>\n        <mo>.</mo>\n        <mo>.</mo>\n        <mo>.</mo>\n      </mstyle>\n    </mrow>\n    <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">{\\displaystyle \\aleph _{0},\\aleph _{1},...,\\aleph _{\\omega },...}</annotation>\n  </semantics>\n</math></span><img src=\"https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/abaebb41b04bdc5625915e704d13f8b46b4c90a0\" class=\"mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:17.576ex; height:2.509ex;\" alt=\"{\\displaystyle \\aleph _{0},\\aleph _{1},...,\\aleph _{\\omega },...}\"></span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">⁠</span></span>, but there is <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Absolute_infinite\" title=\"Absolute infinite\">a largest one</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cardinality","retrieved":1788213604909},{"title":"León Federico Aneiros","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/León_Federico_Aneiros\" title=\"León Federico Aneiros\">León Federico Aneiros</a></b> served as a legislator, a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rector_(academia)#Compound_titles\" title=\"Rector (academia)\">vice-rector</a>, and the archbishop of Buenos Aires?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Le%C3%B3n_Federico_Aneiros","retrieved":1788213604910},{"title":"Colostle","contents":"... that <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Colostle\" title=\"Colostle\">Colostle</a></b></i> won an award for \"Best Rules\" despite reviewers noting that it had few rules?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Colostle","retrieved":1788213604911},{"title":"maple leaf cream cookies","contents":"... that astronauts orbiting the Moon celebrated the moment at which they lost contact with Earth by eating <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maple_leaf_cream_cookie\" title=\"Maple leaf cream cookie\">maple leaf cream cookies</a></b>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maple_leaf_cream_cookie","retrieved":1788213604913}]}